      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_4",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Maddock",
            text: _("The answer is no. Garard, Elensefar has no interest in joining your little war-clique. You’ve already stirred up enough trouble; trade up the river is failing, and goblins are once again raiding my northern border."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Garard",
            text: _("All the more reason to join forces and wipe the orcs out! Think how much territory we could command if the Northlands were fully open to human settlement."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Maddock",
            text: _("If you were <i>winning</i>, certainly, but then we wouldn’t be speaking together here, would we? You’ve never been one for sharing the spoils."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Maddock",
            text: _("Now if you’ll excuse me, warmonger, I have a city to govern."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Maddock",
            x: 18,
            y: 0,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_unit_hidden",
            id: "Maddock",
            hidden: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:teleport",
            id: "Maddock",
            x: 18,
            y: 1,
            to_x: 17,
            to_y: 0,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "",
            x: 18,
            y: 0,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            unit: "u_7",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Garard",
            text: _("Damn his cowardice! Still no word from Lionel?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Eldred",
            text: _("(stares)"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Garard",
            text: _("Speak UP, boy! I raised you to be a killer, not a coward!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Eldred",
            text: _("<span size='x-small'>_You hardly raised me at all...</span>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Garard",
            text: _("Oh, confound it. Why did I let those infernal rumors convince me to send away my best general and most loyal soldiers? Lionel is missing in action, Arand becomes more paranoid by the day, and you still speak softer than a mouse. This is war — Wesnoth needs a warrior prince."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Garard",
            text: _("Even reliable Delfador took off months ago on some wild goose chase in the Northlands. Some days it feels like the whole world is moving against me... perhaps it is an omen of things to come."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Garard",
            x: 34,
            y: 5,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 250,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Garard",
            text: _("The coward’s option once more rears its ugly head. Negotiate, capitulate; yield the border to the butchers. Give unto the orcs their pound of flesh."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Garard",
            text: _("How many would die? How many have already died to this problem of my own making? I can already feel the kings of old judging me in my failure, my squandering of everything they fought so hard to build..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 250,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Garard",
            text: _("No. I will not go down in history as a failed king; a weakling, a coward powerless to protect his people against the savages beyond. I have chosen the path of war, and I will see it through to its bloody end."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "Garard",
          },
          {
            tag: "foreach",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            item: "this_item",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "this_item.facing",
                value: "sw",
                mode: "value",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:unstore_unit",
                variable: "this_item",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Garard",
            text: _("Riders, summon the reserves. Empty Halstead! Empty Weldyn! I want every child old enough to walk and every elder young enough to stand! In two weeks time we march across the ford and assault the Blackcrest war-camp. Come hell or high water, we will yet have our victory."),
          },
          {
            tag: "win",
          },
        ],
      },
    ],
  },
]
